description.en:
Upon casting Resonance Liberation Momentary Union, Resonance Liberation Remnant Entities gains the following enhancements:

-Remnant Entities can be performed 2 more time(s);

-Healing multiplier of Remnant Entities is increased by 20%;

-Remnant Entities deals additional Glacio DMG equal to 1.20% of Baizhi's Max HP.

description.id:
Setelah melancarkan Resonance Liberation Momentary Union, Resonance Liberation Remnant Entities mendapat peningkatan berikut:

-Remnant Entities dapat dilakukan 2 kali lagi;

-Pengali penyembuhan Remnant Entities meningkat sebesar 20%;

-Remnant Entities memberikan tambahan Glacio DMG sebesar 1,20% dari Max HP Baizhi.
